<title>USA: Minntech names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Minntech names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minntech Corp said Friday it has named Jules Fisher to the position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Minntech, Fisher was director of operations accounting at United States Surgical Corp.</p>
<p>Fisher replaces Warren White, who resigned in late August, the company said.</p>
<p>Minntech manufactures medical devices. Its core technologies are in dialysis, reprocessing and sterilants, cardiosurgery and water purification.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
